Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.34,0:24:11.30,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(200,320)}One day the light of love burning in your eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.30,0:24:13.22,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}will transcend time
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.22,0:24:17.29,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}and destroy one of this world's dreams
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.29,0:24:20.93,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}as it spirals toward the apocalypse
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.93,0:24:23.78,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}What is it that you seek
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.78,0:24:27.35,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}now that you're done hesitating?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.35,0:24:32.41,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}Is there a glimpse of hope for tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.41,0:24:36.85,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,620)}beyond this greedy admiration?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.97,0:24:42.06,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(200,320)}I want to be armed with the power
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.06,0:24:45.87,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}to shatter even the darkness in my hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.87,0:24:49.71,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}just like the ancient magic in my childhood dreams,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.71,0:24:53.59,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}the next time I see your innocent smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.59,0:24:57.38,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}In my trembling hands I hold
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.38,0:25:01.21,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}the courage of a plucked flower
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.21,0:25:05.05,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}My feelings are all I can rely on;
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.05,0:25:08.92,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}the prayer that awakens
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.92,0:25:16.62,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,1620)}the light
Dialogue: 5,0:00:02.15,0:00:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Akemi Homura, time traveler.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:06.62,0:00:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,By turning back time\N and changing past events,
Dialogue: 5,0:00:08.91,0:00:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,you have relived this past month over and over across numerous different timelines,
Dialogue: 5,0:00:13.25,0:00:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,seeking the outcome you desire.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:16.87,0:00:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Your existence has answered at least one great mystery:
Dialogue: 5,0:00:21.41,0:00:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does Kaname Madoka possess such great potential as a magical girl?
Dialogue: 5,0:00:26.88,0:00:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can put together a reasonable hypothesis.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:31.22,0:00:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, a magical girl's latent potential
Dialogue: 5,0:00:33.93,0:00:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,is based on the weight of the\N karmic destiny she bears.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:36.68,0:00:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I could have understood if she had been the queen or savior of a country,
Dialogue: 5,0:00:39.41,0:00:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,but I couldn't comprehend why Madoka,\Nwho led only an ordinary life,
Dialogue: 5,0:00:42.84,0:00:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,should have so many threads of fate woven so tightly around her.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:48.47,0:00:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But listen, Homura.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:51.55,0:00:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it possible that Madoka became more powerful as a magical girl
Dialogue: 5,0:00:55.35,0:00:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,every time you reset the timeline?
Dialogue: 5,0:01:01.09,0:01:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought so. You were the cause.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:05.20,0:01:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Or should I call it a side effect of your magic?
Dialogue: 5,0:01:09.24,0:01:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 5,0:01:10.97,0:01:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You traveled through time for just one purpose: to protect Kaname Madoka.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:16.60,0:01:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,By turning back time over and over,\N each time for the same reason and goal,
Dialogue: 5,0:01:20.38,0:01:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,you inadvertently caused multiple timelines to converge together
Dialogue: 5,0:01:25.19,0:01:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,and centered them all on Kaname Madoka.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:28.32,0:01:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If Madoka's threads of fate from each of those separate timelines
Dialogue: 5,0:01:33.22,0:01:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,all ended up linking to the\N Madoka in this current timeline,
Dialogue: 5,0:01:37.59,0:01:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,that would explain why her magical potential appears so impossibly huge.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:42.19,0:01:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,All the karmic destiny you sent spinning across all of those different timelines
Dialogue: 5,0:01:48.11,0:01:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,eventually attached to Kaname Madoka.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:50.47,0:01:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, everything you did was for her.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:55.64,0:01:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent work, Homura.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:57.42,0:02:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You've raised Madoka to be the most powerful witch we've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.98,0:02:03.02,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{OP}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.98,0:03:33.03,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{Episode}
Dialogue: 5,0:03:37.30,0:03:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}The body of Mitakihara Junior High\Nsecond-year Miki Sayaka{**-san},
Dialogue: 5,0:03:40.28,0:03:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}who had been missing since\N the 12th of this month,
Dialogue: 5,0:03:44.09,0:03:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}was discovered today in a\Nroom at a downtown hotel.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:48.83,0:03:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}As there were no signs of a struggle present at the scene,
Dialogue: 5,0:03:52.01,0:03:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}the police have not ruled out either murder or accidental death in their investigation.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:56.59,0:03:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Up next is the weather forecast.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:58.48,0:04:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Tonight, expect moderate winds from the northwest accompanied by rain.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:04.02,0:04:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:12.92,0:04:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Madoka.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:15.89,0:04:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,About Sayaka{**-chan}...
Dialogue: 5,0:04:17.92,0:04:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You really don't know anything\N about what happened?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:20.08,0:04:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:32.96,0:04:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayaka{**-chan} and Kyouko{**-chan} are both dead.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:37.59,0:04:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not really that surprising.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:39.81,0:04:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The signs had been there for quite some time.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:42.87,0:04:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're saying you don't care?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:44.66,0:04:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though you practically caused their deaths?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:49.61,0:04:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, do you ever feel guilty about what happens to livestock?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:54.05,0:04:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you ever think about how their meat ends up on your table?
Dialogue: 5,0:05:03.43,0:05:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 5,0:05:05.20,0:05:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not a rational reaction.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:07.61,0:05:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,If you found that vision to be cruel,\Nthen you're not seeing the whole picture.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:14.49,0:05:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,In exchange for one day\Nbecoming food for humans,
Dialogue: 5,0:05:17.39,0:05:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,livestock are provided for all their lives and sheltered from natural selection.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:21.97,0:05:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Cows, pigs, and chickens all have far higher rates of reproduction in captivity than in the wild.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:28.73,0:05:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't you call that the\Nideal symbiotic relationship?
Dialogue: 5,0:05:33.83,0:05:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to say we're the same?
Dialogue: 5,0:05:36.21,0:05:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, we're far more accommodating\N toward humanity than you are with livestock.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:42.34,0:05:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Though we're not perfect at it, \Nwe at least negotiate with you as sentient beings.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:48.70,0:05:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't believe me?
Dialogue: 5,0:05:50.75,0:05:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,How about I show you, then?
Dialogue: 5,0:05:52.84,0:05:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show you the history that mankind has spent together with the Incubators.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:08.11,0:06:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We have been involved with your civilization since before your recorded history.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:13.29,0:06:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Countless girls throughout history have formed contracts with Incubators,
Dialogue: 5,0:06:17.25,0:06:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,had their wishes granted, and\N ultimately succumbed to despair.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:22.28,0:06:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That which begins with a prayer of hope ends with a curse of despair.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:25.52,0:06:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Such is the cycle that countless\Nmagical girls have repeated to this day.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:30.26,0:06:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Some changed history forever, and elevated\Nyour society to new stages of development.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:36.69,0:06:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it already!
Dialogue: 5,0:06:43.26,0:06:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,They trusted you, and you betrayed them!
Dialogue: 5,0:06:46.28,0:06:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It was not we who betrayed them,
Dialogue: 5,0:06:49.30,0:06:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,but rather their own wishes.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:52.06,0:06:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what their hopes were, \Nanything that goes beyond reason
Dialogue: 5,0:06:56.54,0:06:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,will without fail cause some sort of distortion.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:59.72,0:07:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only natural that this would result in disaster.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:03.52,0:07:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,If you consider a natural consequence like that to be "betrayal,"
Dialogue: 5,0:07:06.69,0:07:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,then their mistake was to make those wishes in the first place.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:11.22,0:07:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that I am calling them foolish.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:13.95,0:07:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be denied that their sacrifices have shaped human history.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:25.25,0:07:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The current standard of living you enjoy was made possible by all those tears shed in the past.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:34.65,0:07:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,If you understand that, then how can you be so obsessed with the lives of a select few?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:42.18,0:07:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you really feel nothing while watching over those girls this whole time?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:46.99,0:07:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you at least try to understand how much they were suffering?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:51.69,0:07:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If we could, we wouldn't have come all \Nthe way to this planet in the first place.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:58.22,0:07:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,In our society,
Dialogue: 5,0:07:59.99,0:08:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,the phenomenon known as "emotion" is\Nnothing more than a rare mental disorder.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:04.49,0:08:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why we were surprised when we found you humans.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:07.95,0:08:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We never imagined a world could exist where each individual possessed its own set of emotions
Dialogue: 5,0:08:12.60,0:08:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,and still managed to coexist with others.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:15.45,0:08:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If none of you had ever come to this planet...
Dialogue: 5,0:08:20.02,0:08:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd probably still be living in caves.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:28.88,0:08:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It really does hurt, losing one\Nof my own students this way.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:34.56,0:08:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. We still don't even know what really happened.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:39.41,0:08:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,One of the third-years is apparently missing as well.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:42.62,0:08:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Our staff meeting was a complete mess.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:45.45,0:08:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess nobody knows anything, do they?
Dialogue: 5,0:08:49.41,0:08:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It sounds like Sayaka{**-chan} had some trouble with a friend over a boy.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:54.49,0:08:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,She's taking all this pretty hard as well.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:58.08,0:09:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Ordinarily, it'd blow over leaving behind a few bittersweet memories, but since it ended like this...
Dialogue: 5,0:09:06.52,0:09:11.31,Default,,1,1,0,,The police are going to rule it accidental death,\Nexacerbated by mental stress after running away from home.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:11.87,0:09:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't have any leads to go on.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:15.47,0:09:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,How's Madoka{**-chan} taking it?
Dialogue: 5,0:09:17.49,0:09:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:19.80,0:09:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,My gut tells me she knows\N something about all this.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:23.88,0:09:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But it doesn't seem like\Nshe's lying to me either.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:26.98,0:09:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the first time I haven't been \Nable to tell what she's really thinking.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:31.10,0:09:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Pathetic, right? I don't know what my own daughter is up to.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:36.21,0:09:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I never thought I'd see you at such a loss.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:39.00,0:09:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Lately, something has seemed\N a little off about her.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:42.64,0:09:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I can tell something's\Nweighing on her mind.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:45.96,0:09:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,but she hasn't come to talk\N to me about it like usual.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:48.44,0:09:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought she knew she\Ncould always rely on me...
Dialogue: 5,0:09:51.87,0:09:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard with kids that age.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:54.62,0:09:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You turn around one day, \Nand suddenly they're all grown up.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:58.14,0:10:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be a pretty big\Nshock for the parents.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:01.21,0:10:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess you're right.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:03.16,0:10:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,At this point, you just\Nneed to believe in her.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:05.80,0:10:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure what Madoka{**-chan} needs most right now is some time to sort out her feelings.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:10.18,0:10:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to give her some space.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:12.74,0:10:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so hard not being able to do anything.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:16.37,0:10:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the Junko I've always known.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:30.41,0:10:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,May I come in?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:40.11,0:10:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that... the Walpurgisnacht?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:43.50,0:10:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyouko{**-chan} told me about it.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:45.40,0:10:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,She said the two of you were teaming up to take down a witch neither of you could handle alone.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:50.92,0:10:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been preparing for it this whole time, haven't you?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:56.53,0:10:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Will the city be in danger?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:59.43,0:11:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Unlike the witches you've seen so far, \Nthis one doesn't need to hide itself within a barrier.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:05.12,0:11:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If it manifests even once, thousands will die.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:09.97,0:11:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Since ordinary people can't see it,
Dialogue: 5,0:11:12.28,0:11:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,they'll think the destruction was caused by an\Nearthquake, tornado, or other natural disaster.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:17.79,0:11:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So it absolutely has to be stopped, right?
Dialogue: 5,0:11:24.96,0:11:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that Kyouko{**-chan}'s... dead too...
Dialogue: 5,0:11:28.22,0:11:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,you're the only magical girl\Nleft who can fight it, so I—
Dialogue: 5,0:11:32.97,0:11:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I can do it on my own.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:34.93,0:11:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Sakura Kyouko may not have been able to defeat the Walpurgisnacht alone, but I can.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:40.24,0:11:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I never really needed Kyouko's\N assistance to begin with.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:43.42,0:11:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I just agreed so she wouldn't lose face.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:46.04,0:11:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 5,0:11:49.38,0:11:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it...
Dialogue: 5,0:11:50.52,0:11:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to believe you.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:55.16,0:11:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to think you'd lie to me.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:59.03,0:12:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet, I just can't believe you're really going to be all right.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:02.52,0:12:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I just can't believe what you're saying is true.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:10.03,0:12:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how to tell you what I really feel.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:13.80,0:12:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Homura{**-chan}...
Dialogue: 5,0:12:16.29,0:12:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Because...
Dialogue: 5,0:12:17.44,0:12:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not even living in the same time as you!
Dialogue: 5,0:12:48.33,0:12:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, I... I came from the future.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:52.57,0:12:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I've met you over and over again,
Dialogue: 5,0:12:54.86,0:12:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,and each and every time,\NI've had to watch you die.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:00.01,0:13:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I save you?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:02.15,0:13:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I change your fate?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:04.64,0:13:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I've gone back in time over and over again, searching for that answer.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:09.02,0:13:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That means... Huh?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:12.94,0:13:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:14.17,0:13:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I must sound crazy, right?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:16.28,0:13:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I must be creeping you out.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:19.40,0:13:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,To you, I'm just some transfer\Nstudent you met a month ago.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:27.29,0:13:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,But to me...
Dialogue: 5,0:13:29.85,0:13:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,To me, you are...
Dialogue: 5,0:13:34.09,0:13:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The more I repeat all this, the further in time we drift from one another.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:39.74,0:13:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Our feelings also drift further apart,\N and my words don't reach you anymore.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:44.00,0:13:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The truth is, I think I lost\Nmyself a long time ago.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:49.01,0:13:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Homura{**-chan}...
Dialogue: 5,0:13:50.69,0:13:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I will save you.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:53.68,0:13:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That was all I had in mind\N when I began this.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:56.61,0:14:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And now that I've come this far, \Nit's the one thing I have left to guide me.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:02.81,0:14:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all right if you don't understand.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:04.65,0:14:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all right if my words don't reach you.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:07.29,0:14:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But please...
Dialogue: 5,0:14:09.32,0:14:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg of you.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:11.09,0:14:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me protect you.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:29.32,0:14:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,These thunderclouds are spreading\Nand rotating at unbelievable speeds.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:32.88,0:14:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a clear sign that a supercell is forming!
Dialogue: 5,0:14:35.11,0:14:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Issue an evacuation order at once!
Dialogue: 5,0:14:37.61,0:14:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}An evacuation order has been issued as of 7AM this morning due to urgent weather conditions.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:43.73,0:14:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}All residents must immediately evacuate to the nearest shelter.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:49.20,0:14:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}This is the Mitakihara Municipal Office.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:52.55,0:14:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}An evacuation order...
Dialogue: 5,0:15:00.69,0:15:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's coming.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:10.64,0:15:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this a sleepover?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:12.49,0:15:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we camping?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:14.15,0:15:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. We're all camping here tonight!
Dialogue: 5,0:15:19.80,0:15:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Homura{**-chan}...
Dialogue: 5,0:16:13.27,0:16:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,This time...
Dialogue: 5,0:16:17.21,0:16:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll finish it once and for all.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:15.17,0:18:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Madoka?
Dialogue: 5,0:18:16.45,0:18:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I need to use the bathroom.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:20.55,0:18:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it true that Homura{**-chan} can win by herself?
Dialogue: 5,0:18:24.17,0:18:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I said no, would you believe me?
Dialogue: 5,0:18:29.88,0:18:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no point in me\Ntrying to convince you now.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:32.86,0:18:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,See for yourself.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:35.33,0:18:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,See just how far she can get against the Walpurgisnacht.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:40.65,0:18:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does she push herself so hard to fight?
Dialogue: 5,0:18:43.18,0:18:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Because she still hasn't given up hope.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:46.90,0:18:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If it comes down to it, I'm sure she'll nullify this timeline like the others, and continue fighting.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:53.01,0:18:57.46,Default,,1,1,0,,She'll continue to repeat this meaningless chain of events, failures be damned.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:58.02,0:19:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,At this point, it's no longer possible for her to stop or give up.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:08.42,0:19:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The moment she believes that everything was pointless, that your fate cannot be changed,
Dialogue: 5,0:19:14.76,0:19:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Akemi Homura will succumb to\Ndespair and become a Grief Seed.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:19.92,0:19:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,She knows that all too well.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:22.47,0:19:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why she doesn't have a choice.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:25.27,0:19:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,She must continue to fight, \Neven if she has no chance of winning.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:30.38,0:19:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're saying that as long as she\Ncontinues to hope, she can't be saved?
Dialogue: 5,0:19:33.78,0:19:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:34.97,0:19:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like every other magical\N girl throughout history.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:38.64,0:19:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Madoka, you saw it too, didn't you?
Dialogue: 5,0:19:51.11,0:19:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 5,0:19:52.07,0:19:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 5,0:19:54.47,0:19:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But!
Dialogue: 5,0:20:02.33,0:20:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 5,0:20:04.84,0:20:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:07.26,0:20:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to go save my friend—
Dialogue: 5,0:20:09.99,0:20:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave that to the firefighters.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:12.17,0:20:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We civilians have to stay put.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:13.73,0:20:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It has to be me!
Dialogue: 5,0:20:17.51,0:20:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not the only person in this world!
Dialogue: 5,0:20:20.56,0:20:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you even know how much\N the people around you—
Dialogue: 5,0:20:24.54,0:20:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 5,0:20:26.95,0:20:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I really do understand.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:30.99,0:20:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you too, Mom. Dad too.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:35.12,0:20:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I know how much you all care about me.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:37.99,0:20:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I need to value my own life.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:41.64,0:20:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is different.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:43.26,0:20:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's because you're all so important to me that I have to protect you.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:46.73,0:20:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That's exactly why... there's \Nsomewhere I have to be right now!
Dialogue: 5,0:20:52.68,0:20:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And you can't tell me what this is about?
Dialogue: 5,0:20:57.11,0:20:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Take me with you, then.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:01.28,0:21:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:02.66,0:21:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay with Dad and Tatsuya.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:05.22,0:21:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make them worry about you.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:09.41,0:21:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You said I grew up to be a good girl, right?
Dialogue: 5,0:21:14.34,0:21:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That I don't lie and I don't do anything bad.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:19.16,0:21:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you still believe that?
Dialogue: 5,0:21:21.35,0:21:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you trust that what I'm doing is right?
Dialogue: 5,0:21:29.97,0:21:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you certain you're not making a mistake?
Dialogue: 5,0:21:32.82,0:21:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not being misled by anyone's lies?
Dialogue: 5,0:21:35.26,0:21:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:41.69,0:21:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Mom.
Dialogue: 5,0:23:26.37,0:23:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 5,0:23:28.31,0:23:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You've done enough, Homura{**-chan}.
Dialogue: 5,0:23:31.42,0:23:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Madoka...
Dialogue: 5,0:23:45.65,0:23:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Madoka...
Dialogue: 5,0:23:46.83,0:23:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're...
Dialogue: 5,0:23:51.20,0:23:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Homura{**-chan}, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.96,0:23:56.00,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{ED}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.05,0:25:26.09,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{Preview}
Dialogue: 6,0:25:26.95,0:25:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an1}If someone says it's wrong to have hope,
Dialogue: 6,0:25:30.12,0:25:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an1}I will tell them they're wrong every single time.
Dialogue: 6,0:25:34.59,0:25:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an1}I know my determination will never waver.
Dialogue: 6,0:25:37.42,0:25:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an1}My very best friend.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:59.47,0:22:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I let it get any further...
Dialogue: 5,0:22:01.97,0:22:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}it'll reach the shelter.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:04.35,0:22:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Whatever happens, I have to stop it right here!
Dialogue: 5,0:22:16.94,0:22:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No way...
Dialogue: 5,0:22:33.84,0:22:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why...
Dialogue: 5,0:22:36.45,0:22:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why can't I beat it, no matter how many times I try?!
Dialogue: 5,0:22:48.18,0:22:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I do this again, I'll only add to Madoka's karmic burden.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:53.12,0:22:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}In the end, everything I've done has...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.93,0:02:41.74,Opening-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(0,480)}I'll walk upon this Earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.74,0:02:43.81,Opening-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5}and pierce this shadowy veil of unease,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.81,0:02:47.42,Opening-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(0,580)}as many times as necessary
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.54,0:03:08.87,Opening-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(0,580)}with these unwavering feelings
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.72,0:03:24.52,Opening-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5}the beautiful blue sky will always be waiting for me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.31,0:02:06.69,Opening-Connect-English-blue,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(200,0)}I'll never forget the promises we exchanged
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.69,0:02:09.19,Opening-Connect-English-blue,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5}I still see it when I close my eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.19,0:02:10.81,Opening-Connect-English-blue,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5}I'll move forward as I cast off
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.81,0:02:14.69,Opening-Connect-English-blue,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(0,580)}this darkness engulfing me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.97,0:02:30.80,Opening-Connect-English-dreams,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(200,480)}How long will it be before
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.80,0:02:36.93,Opening-Connect-English-dreams,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(0,480)}I see that lost future again?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.52,0:03:26.85,Opening-Connect-English-night,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5}So I won't be afraid
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.85,0:03:32.98,Opening-Connect-English-night,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(0,1020)}No matter what happens next, I won't give in
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.42,0:02:52.90,Opening-Connect-English-white,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(0,480)\1c&H50B657&}T{\1c&H59B257&}h{\1c&H62AF58&}e{\1c&H6AAC59&} {\1c&H6FAA59&}c{\1c&H76A75A&}l{\1c&H7BA65B&}o{\1c&H83A35B&}c{\1c&H88955A&}k{\1c&H8C8959&} {\1c&H8E8058&}t{\1c&H927557&}h{\1c&H976656&}a{\1c&H9B5A54&}t{\1c&H9E5053&}'{\1c&HA04853&}s{\1c&H9E4859&} {\1c&H9C485E&}e{\1c&H9A4866&}n{\1c&H97486E&}d{\1c&H954874&}l{\1c&H93487A&}e{\1c&H904881&}s{\1c&H884F85&}s{\1c&H825688&}l{\1c&H795E8C&}y{\1c&H72658F&} {\1c&H6B6C92&}t{\1c&H657194&}i{\1c&H5C7A98&}c{\1c&H51849D&}k{\1c&H4B8D9C&}e{\1c&H4C948F&}d{\1c&H4C9888&} {\1c&H4D9F7D&}a{\1c&H4EA86D&}w{\1c&H4FAF61&}a{\1c&H50B657&}y
