Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.87,0:03:14.68,Opening-Connect-English-yellow,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5}My heart started racing once again to paint the future
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.68,0:03:18.72,Opening-Connect-English-yellow,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(0,480)}Even if I get stuck in a maze,
